{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:30:24+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fantasy Online 2", "steam_appid": 2957110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957110/extras/aac039ade92a713478c69390d7a61d4f.avif?t=1792644375\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957110/extras_big/aac039ade92a713478c69390d7a61d4f.avif?t=1792644375 width=1560 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a vast 2D pixel art world in Fantasy Online 2, an MMORPG where retro charm meets modern gameplay. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive Pixel Art World: Eleven distinct zones filled with unique biomes and challenges, with more on the horizon. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Character Customization: Build your hero with a skill system based on Strength, Stamina, Agility, and Intellect. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting: Delve into a crafting system where you can create powerful weapons, armor, and essential storage bags. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collection: Embark on a collector's journey with a system designed to let you store every equipable item in the game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banking: Safeguard your treasures and expand your vault as your inventory grows. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Quests and Battle Passes: Embark on quests and enhance your gameplay with a new take on battle passes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guild and Party Systems: Team up with friends in parties or join forces in player-run guilds. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thriving Player Economy: Buy or sell items in a comprehensive market system.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the rich pixelated landscapes of Fantasy Online 2 and carve out your destiny in a world that blends nostalgia with MMORPG elements. Play now and forge your path to glory!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957110/extras/aac039ade92a713478c69390d7a61d4f.avif?t=1792644375\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957110/extras_big/aac039ade92a713478c69390d7a61d4f.avif?t=1792644375 width=1560 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a vast 2D pixel art world in Fantasy Online 2, an MMORPG where retro charm meets modern gameplay. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive Pixel Art World: Eleven distinct zones filled with unique biomes and challenges, with more on the horizon. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Character Customization: Build your hero with a skill system based on Strength, Stamina, Agility, and Intellect. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting: Delve into a crafting system where you can create powerful weapons, armor, and essential storage bags. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collection: Embark on a collector's journey with a system designed to let you store every equipable item in the game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banking: Safeguard your treasures and expand your vault as your inventory grows. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Quests and Battle Passes: Embark on quests and enhance your gameplay with a new take on battle passes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guild and Party Systems: Team up with 